  "storage_layout": "Each RLE run: count u8, then palette index u16 little-endian. The 579-entry RGBA palette includes transparent index zero. Original 260x260 frames are retained.",
  "display_alpha": "Shared across web and terminal: on the original sample coordinates sx=5*x+2, sy=5*y+2, retain the original RGB iff source alpha >= Bayer4[sy%4][sx%4]*16+8; otherwise transparent. Bayer4=[[0,8,2,10],[12,4,14,6],[3,11,1,9],[15,7,13,5]]. No RGB quantization or face overlays.",
  "playback_clock": "Original atlas durations are 50ms. The existing host presentation clock is 100ms and samples the original timeline without stretching durations; this does not claim every 20fps source frame is presented by that host."
}
